cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Trinity B001: Ternary Neural Networks"
title: "Trinity B001: Ternary Neural Networks — Complete Scientific Framework"
abstract: "We present HSLM (Hierarchical Sacred Language Model), a 1.95M parameter ternary language model achieving PPL=125 on TinyStories. Our architecture introduces Sacred Attention (φ-based scaling), Consciousness Gate (dual-system reasoning), Phi Scaling (golden ratio architecture), T-JEPA (ternary masked prediction), and Cosine LR with φ-warmup. Implemented in pure Zig, HSLM achieves 377KB model size and 1200 tok/s throughput."
